WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:01.350
Last time on...

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:03.060
<i>Love Live! Sunshine!!</i>

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:05.770
Although we passed the Love Live qualifiers,

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:07.860
we ran out of funding for our activities.

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:11.280
Then, we realized that
Dia was troubled by something.

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:13.570
At any rate, to think that...

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:16.120
Dia wants to be called Dia-<i>chan</i>...

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:19.540
Dia tried various ways to make her wish
come true, but without success.

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:23.480
I want you to be who you are, Dia-<i>san</i>.

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:27.940
I don't really care how you refer to me.

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:38.180
The rain has started 
pouring again, hasn't it?

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:41.280
I heard that it'll get worse
as night approaches, so...

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:44.850
It seems it would be best to stop here.

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:47.610
With the regional prelims coming up soon...

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:50.520
We now have more than
fifty prospective students too, right?

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:53.820
I do understand how you guys feel,
but safety comes first.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.830
Let's call it a day.

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:57.610
Here!

00:00:57.610 --> 00:00:58.620
What's this?

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:00.620
"Nice 'N Warm Pocket Warmer"

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:04.070
They say, "Good things come
to those who warm," right?

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:10.040
"Tochiman Inn"

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:10.040
Kanan-<i>chan</i> and Riko-<i>chan</i> 
are riding in our car.

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:11.670
Why don't you ride with us too, You-<i>chan</i>?

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:12.920
You don't mind?

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:14.550
What about you, Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>?

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:17.260
Storms stir the very soul 
of this fallen angel.

00:01:17.630 --> 00:01:20.220
Within her wings, a hidden power is born!

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:22.430
Now isn't the time for make-believe.

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:25.640
My base lies near here.

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:28.940
Should the worst befall me, I can always
use teleportation to get there.

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:30.270
Well, it is pretty close.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:31.690
--Bye-<i>nny</i>!
--<i>Zura</i>!

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.480
Have a good evening!

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:40.030
This sky makes me feel ill at ease...

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:42.990
It seems to portend the start
of something akin to a final battle.

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:49.290
Hey!

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:51.750
Wait!

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:54.710
Halt! I command you!

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:57.470
What peculiar movements...

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:02.050
Could it be that...
some force is attempting to guide me?

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:34.170
<i>Let's throw our all at each other</i>
<i>and grab hold of the future!</i>

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:44.810
<i>The sky and this ocean are both on our side</i>

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:48.770
<i>Shining and saying, "Go, do your best!"</i>

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:55.480
<i>To let our voices reach far, far away</i>

00:02:55.480 --> 00:03:00.400
<i>Shall we shout our dreams louder?</i>

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:02.160
<i>(Full of hope)</i>

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:06.490
<i>Today pulls tomorrow toward itself</i>

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:15.090
<i>It's really fun to grasp the magnet</i>
<i>in my heart and run right now!</i>

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:17.210
<i>(Let's always go together)</i>

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:20.010
<i>What shall we do about the future?!</i>

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:27.810
<i>Everyone laughs and cries</i>
<i>as</i> <i>they</i> <i>look for the shape of their dreams</i>

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:36.230
<i>Because I'm sure the</i> <i>future</i> <i>us</i>
<i>will have the answer</i>

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:44.320
<i>Let's run with everything we have</i>
<i>and become the shining wind</i>

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:47.660
<i>We got dream</i>

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:51.290
You can do it. You'll be fine!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.930
I promise Shiitake won't move!

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:57.170
"#5 'Taking in a Dog.'"

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:13.560
I can't do it!

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:15.350
You're making a racket.

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:16.360
Riko-<i>chan</i>'s eyes met Shiitake's,

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:18.940
and she thought she might
be able to touch Shiitake.

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:19.920
Really?!

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:23.140
Okay, go ahead.

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:38.000
I can't! I can't do it!

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:42.210
Hmm... I think Shiitake loves you, Riko-<i>chan</i>.

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:44.300
That's not true!

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:45.880
It <i>is</i> true!

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:48.430
I heard that dogs have
a mysterious ability to distinguish

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:50.010
friends from foes by just looking at them.

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:50.810
What?

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:52.850
Let's start already!

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:54.520
Okay.

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:58.810
"Love Live! Strategy Meeting"

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.240
We definitely must decide today!

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:00.980
We don't have much time left, you know.

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:02.320
I know, <i>zura</i>.

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:04.860
But coming up with a theme is...

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:08.370
Even still, "darkness" is
completely out of the question.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:11.660
Why?! Fallen angels
and darkness go hand in hand.

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:15.040
The path of Yohane, the dark fallen angel
who allied herself with Aqours--

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:16.710
We gotta go with "shine"!

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:17.920
Hey! Listen!

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:23.930
Well, "shine" is something Chika
has been chasing after from the start.

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:27.970
But in order to
broaden the potential of Aqours,

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:30.180
we need to explore more options.

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:35.140
What?! Is this Saint Snow?

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:39.270
We shouldn't get hung up on just one thing.
We need to have some variety,

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:41.610
or we won't be able
to proceed to the nationals.

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:45.820
Yeah. Our next challenge is the
regional prelims, which we failed last time.

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:48.960
Yeah, we want something new.

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:54.750
She's trying to deceive us again
using glasses like these... Hm?

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:00.890
She did say,
"Good things come to those who wait."

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:05.960
Mari-<i>chan</i>'s attention span
is pretty short, so...

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:07.460
Right, Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>?

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:08.510
Whoa!

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:10.760
Y-Yoshiko-<i>chan</i> turned into Shiitake-<i>chan</i>!

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:12.620
As if!

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:16.150
What's the fuss?

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:18.520
It's from Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>.

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:22.150
I sensed emanations of some force
coming from the celestial sphere,

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:24.860
so I have left this plane of existence
in order to investigate.

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:26.400
What does she mean?

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:29.970
Basically, she went home, <i>zura</i>.

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:35.620
What? You want me to bring it over now?

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:40.000
Yeah. Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>'s mom left it here.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:42.380
People need their cells
in case of emergency, right? So...

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:44.420
Okay, I guess I could.

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:51.790
It was around here, right...?

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:02.460
Hm? What's this?

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:09.230
Be quiet!

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:12.490
Y-Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>?

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:16.660
It's Yohane! What're you doing here?

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:19.900
Well, I brought the cell
your mom left at our house.

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:25.120
Here's some food for you.

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:28.760
Oh, how cute.

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:31.920
You don't have to eat so fast.

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:35.100
What?

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:37.260
Can't you tell? It's a dog.

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:39.220
Yeah.

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:43.670
Oh, how cute.

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:47.860
How cute... Yep... Yep...

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:49.190
Cute...

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:52.530
Go!

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:06.510
What was that for?!

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:09.300
You really don't do well with dogs, huh?

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:10.460
So what?!

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:12.220
You found this dog?

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:14.740
No, I encountered this dog.
A chance encounter.

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:17.760
Destiny brought the two of us together.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:21.790
I-I see... So, you decided
to take in this dog, huh?

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:24.810
No?

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:28.570
Pets are not allowed at my place.

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:30.570
I-Is that right?

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:33.240
I have a favor to ask.

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:34.320
I won't do it!

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:35.900
I haven't asked anything yet!

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:38.610
There's no way that I can do it.

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:41.930
It would just be for a little while.

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:45.570
I'll find a new home for the dog, so...!

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:50.670
Oh yeah! Why don't you ask either
Hanamaru-<i>chan</i> or Ruby-<i>chan</i>?

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:51.630
They might...

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:56.090
No. It seems they'd have a hard time
getting permission from their parents.

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:57.340
What about Mari-<i>chan</i>?

00:08:57.640 --> 00:09:01.100
Her family runs a hotel.
Kanan's family runs a shop, too.

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:03.250
At Chika's place, they've got Shiitake.

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:06.150
Then what about You-<i>chan</i>?

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:07.730
You don't want to do it that badly?

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:09.910
Well, it's more like...

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:11.500
Go!

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:20.030
In any case, please!

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:25.950
This dog is as crucial to the fallen angel
Yohane as the twilight of the gods!

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:27.410
What?

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:32.000
Shhh...

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:36.220
I brought the dog back with me,
but what do I do now?

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:41.840
Be quiet. I haven't
told my mom yet, you know.

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:45.350
Oh, are you hungry?

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:48.620
Yoshiko-<i>chan</i> said this 
one is your favorite...

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:51.650
Hold on a minute.

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:56.080
I suppose you can't eat like that, huh?

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:03.040
You can't come close to me, okay?

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:05.000
This is just so you can eat, okay?

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:06.790
Just so you can eat, okay?

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:20.970
A mysterious ability
to distinguish friends from foes, huh?

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:27.520
Shh, okay?

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:33.030
One, two, three, four.
One, two, now close in there.

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:34.060
Okay!

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:38.280
Ruby-<i>chan</i>, move a bit inwards.

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:41.070
Yep. You've gotten much better.

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:42.410
Really?!

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:45.790
One more time... is what 
I'd like to say, but...

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:48.500
The days have gotten shorter, so...

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.420
We don't wanna hurt ourselves.

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:53.290
Let's work on the rest
when we practice in Numazu.

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:54.590
Then are we done?!

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:56.540
Yeah. What's going on?

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:59.300
What? Well... Uhm...

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:01.550
I'm going home now.

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:03.180
What? Again?

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:05.640
Did something happen, <i>zura</i>?

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:09.710
Come to think of it, she goes home
right after we finish practice, doesn't she?

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:13.360
I'm home!

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:18.110
Were you good?
I've got something for you today!

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:20.150
Ta-da!

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:21.830
Doesn't that look fun?

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:24.370
Here you go.

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:27.570
How is it? Is it fun?

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.040
Yes?

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.930
Riko, your friend is here.

00:11:31.930 --> 00:11:34.040
Ah, Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>...

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:35.140
It's Yohane!

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:38.420
Oh? You still have that dog?

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:42.890
Ahh... Yes. I was asked to keep
the dog just a little bit longer, so...

00:11:42.900 --> 00:11:44.470
I see.

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:47.060
But since Riko-<i>chan</i> isn't a big fan of dogs,

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:49.930
I thought I'd keep the dog
at my place after all.

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:54.560
Oh? I heard you couldn't
because you live in a condo.

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:56.070
It won't be for long, so don't worry.

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:58.780
I looked after this dog
because you said you couldn't.

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:01.700
Now, it's dinner time, Nocturne.

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:03.240
Nocturne?

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:05.780
Well, make yourself at home.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:10.770
Hey! What's this "Nocturne" business?!

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:12.190
It's this dog's name!

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:13.080
Huh?!

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:15.630
It's sad for a dog not to have a name, right?

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:17.960
I'm the one who encountered this dog!

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:21.350
The name is Lailaps! That's a great name!

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:24.470
--Love Live?
--Lailaps!

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:27.470
Besides, what's up with you?!
I thought you don't do well with dogs!

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:29.680
I don't, but what can I do?

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:32.850
You're the one who asked me
to look after the dog, Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>.

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:33.920
It's Yohane!

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:37.150
Can I talk to you both?

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:37.820
--What?!
--What?!

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:41.030
I got this in Numazu...

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:45.610
"Missing Dog" "This dog went missing
around Numazu Station. The name is 'Anko.'
The breed is Sheltie. If you see or shelter the dog, please contact us. Thank you. Aramaki"

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:45.170
Ahh...

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:47.660
Anko! I'm glad!

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:50.160
You're tickling me!

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:51.950
G-Glad to be of help.

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:54.670
Thank you very much.

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:56.420
Anko, you say thank you, too.

00:12:58.040 --> 00:12:59.240
Thank you!

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:08.680
Well then, we'll get going.

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:09.930
Bye-bye!

00:13:11.960 --> 00:13:14.520
Lailaps!

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:18.860
<i>Love Live! Sunshine!!</i>

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:22.440
"Theme" "Sea" "Friendship" "Dream"
"Miracle" "D̶a̶r̶k̶n̶e̶s̶s̶" "Radiant!"

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:29.450
"Dance Formation Idea Notebook"

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:32.410
Hm? Everyone's on the rooftop.
What's wrong?

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:35.660
Yeah, I was wondering
what kind of song would be good...

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:38.290
Yeah...

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:40.790
Do you have some ideas?

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:45.760
No... I'll just try my best
so that I won't have regrets later on.

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:48.760
This will be my last Love Live, so...

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:50.990
Last one...

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:56.770
Dia, Mari, and I created songs here.
Then our feelings got connected.

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:59.590
A series of coincidences
have led us to where we are now.

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:02.840
In the end, I want to be able to think
that I did everything I could.

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:05.860
Chika-<i>chan</i>! There's a problem!

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:08.820
Riko-<i>chan</i> and Yoshiko-<i>chan</i> are...

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:10.050
Is something wrong?

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:12.280
...emotionally unstable.

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:14.420
Nocturne...

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:16.490
Lailaps...

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.250
--Go get it!
--Go get it!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.250
They're syncing?

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:26.120
But why are those two like that?

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:29.300
Could it be that they've been
possessed by an evil spirit, <i>zura</i>?

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:32.550
You seem kind of like Yoshiko-<i>chan</i> a bit.

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:33.350
<i>Zura</i>.

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:35.590
Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>.

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:37.280
It's Yohane.

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:40.460
Let's go practice.

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:44.900
Yeah. I'll move my body
to my heart's content,

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:48.110
and cast away this gloom forevermo--

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:49.280
Actually, nevermore.

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:54.090
It was good that the dog
was returned to the owner, but...

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.950
This is wrong!

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:57.620
What?

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:02.600
When you really think about it,
we have no proof that she's the owner!

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:07.630
Even if she had a dog,
it's possible that it wasn't Lailaps!

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:10.910
It's possible that it was a dog
that looks exactly like Lailaps.

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:12.550
That's too much of a stretch.

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:14.300
We'll go get the dog back.

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:15.220
Say what?!

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:19.940
I told you this before. That dog and I
have a contract of the highest order.

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:22.190
We're connected by destiny.

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:25.230
That's absurd. That'll 
cause trouble for them!

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:27.750
Fine then! I'll go by myself!

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:32.820
Why are you following me?

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:37.030
Because... I'm responsible, 
too, more or less.

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:43.580
As I thought, a lot of evil energy
is emanating from their house.

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:47.210
Really? It just looks like
an ordinary house to me.

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:49.660
Gasp!

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:54.930
I feel it... I sense the spirit
of Lailaps behind that fence...

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:57.010
--Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>...
--It's Yohane!

00:15:57.010 --> 00:16:01.060
According to this address,
isn't their house... this one?

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:01.980
What?

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:04.230
"Missing Dog" "This dog went missing
around Numazu Station. The name is 'Anko.'
The breed is Sheltie. If you see or shelter the dog, please contact us. Thank you. Aramaki"

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:04.230
Yeah, this is the one.

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:06.730
True... I feel it.

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:09.030
Didn't you say the same thing earlier?

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:11.490
Shut up! I'll summon the dog.

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.910
Come out. Come out.

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:19.580
Little demon Lailaps, come to your master.

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:21.710
Oh, hello. Thanks for the other day.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:22.410
What?

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:26.830
Well... Um... Goodbye!

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:30.300
The dog isn't coming out, huh?

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:34.300
As I thought,
someone seems to be interfering.

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:35.520
Now that it's come to this...

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:37.300
Now that it's come to this...?

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:38.780
We'll wait until the dog comes out!

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:42.640
Are you serious? It could take hours.

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:44.390
If you don't want to, just go home.

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:48.860
As I told you before,
that dog is special to me.

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:50.470
But...

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:54.820
"Mom"
"When are you coming home?"

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:05.290
"Mom"
"When are you coming home?"
"I'll be home soon"

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:14.240
Rain...

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:25.480
Riko...

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:27.160
You'll catch a cold like that.

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:28.610
And, this...

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:29.880
I don't want it.

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:32.730
Here.

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:39.020
Why did you come back?

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:41.790
When I thought about it, I realized that

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:44.620
if the dog really comes out,
I'd miss it if I wasn't here.

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:47.170
I'm the one who
encountered the dog first, okay?!

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:49.350
I know that, but...

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:55.090
Why destiny?

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:56.090
About what?

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:56.930
The dog.

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:59.260
Destiny is destiny.

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:01.390
That may be true, but...

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:06.390
Do you think fallen angels really exist?

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:07.310
What?

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:11.770
I've had very bad luck 
ever since I was a child.

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:16.650
When I go outside, it always rains.

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:17.820
I often trip.

00:18:18.090 --> 00:18:20.520
Unlike everyone else, I can't
make things work no matter what I do.

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:22.830
So, I thought...

00:18:23.440 --> 00:18:25.930
because I'm special,

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:28.670
an invisible power is at work.

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:30.450
That's why a fallen angel...

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:34.000
Of course, there's no way
that fallen angels exist.

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:36.190
I've already kind of figured that out.

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:38.680
So, I try not to say anything
about fallen angels in class.

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:40.380
But...

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:44.600
I wondered if such things 
really don't exist...

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:47.710
Things like destiny... Invisible powers...

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:51.740
Then I encountered that dog.

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:56.250
It was as if I was
drawn by an invisible power.

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:59.490
I thought it was definitely 
not a coincidence,

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:03.140
but that I was being guided by something.

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:08.510
I thought some mysterious power was at work.

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:12.150
The rain...

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:14.220
It stopped.

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:15.810
Here, some Lailaps.

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:19.590
"Full of <i>anko</i>" "Sweet Bean Soup"

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:21.440
Nocturne!

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:22.550
The rain stopped!

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:25.520
Moe-<i>chan</i>! Can you come over?

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:27.470
Okay!

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:29.760
Anko, wait for me here, okay?

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:44.280
"Full of <i>anko</i>" "Sweet Bean Soup"

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:45.530
Notice me.

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:50.540
"Full of <i>anko</i>" "Sweet Bean Soup"

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:54.840
The dog looked at you.

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:56.750
It's me. Do you recognize me?

00:19:58.510 --> 00:20:00.090
Anko!

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:04.470
I'm sorry. Mom said that
I can't take you out for a walk

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:07.880
because it's still wet outside.
Let's go back inside.

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:13.190
It seems that it really was
a coincidence after all.

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:16.400
To think that the dog
didn't notice fallen angel Yohane.

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:21.740
But the dog looked at you.

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:22.860
What?

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:24.860
I think invisible powers exist.

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:28.510
Not just in you, but inside everyone.

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:30.790
You think so?

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:31.790
Yep!

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:33.580
So, I think the invisible power
is certainly at work

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:37.030
as long as you believe in it.

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:41.540
Just as I'd expect from my little demon!

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:46.200
I, Yohane, hereby certify you
as one of my elite little demons!

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:48.810
Thank you, Yohane-<i>chan</i>!

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:49.980
It's Yoshiko! Hm?

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:06.160
A series of coincidences
have led us to where we are, huh?

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:08.700
"Tochiman Inn"

00:21:12.390 --> 00:21:14.370
Riko-<i>chan</i>, what's going on?

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:15.650
Chika-<i>chan</i>...

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:19.710
I thought maybe I'd try...
since this is also a chance encounter.

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:20.460
Huh?

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:24.050
You know, I thought that
there may not be such a thing

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:26.340
as coincidence in this world.

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:29.300
No such thing as coincidence...

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:32.680
Many different people carry
many different feelings with them.

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:36.690
"Tochiman"

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:36.690
Those feelings become an invisible power
that brings people together.

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:39.190
So, we encounter each 
other as if it's destiny.

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:43.510
Everything has a meaning.

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:45.360
Yeah!

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:48.320
We can't see it, but it's there!

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:14.930
"Tochiman"

00:22:05.090 --> 00:22:08.060
Isn't that way of thinking wonderful?

00:22:15.180 --> 00:22:18.060
<i>Try and be brave</i>

00:22:18.060 --> 00:22:20.610
<i>I know it's actually scary</i>

00:22:20.610 --> 00:22:26.610
<i>It's not like I was able</i>
<i>to</i> <i>do it from the start, either</i>

00:22:26.610 --> 00:22:29.450
<i>I messed up a lot</i>

00:22:29.450 --> 00:22:32.120
<i>I was really frustrated</i>

00:22:32.120 --> 00:22:37.670
<i>But</i> <i>that</i> <i>gave</i> <i>me</i> <i>strength,</i>
<i>so</i> <i>just</i> <i>don't</i> <i>give</i> <i>up</i>

00:22:37.670 --> 00:22:43.380
<i>Tears</i> <i>in</i> <i>your</i> <i>eyes</i>
<i>that</i> <i>want</i> <i>to</i> <i>try</i> <i>believing</i>

00:22:43.380 --> 00:22:47.630
<i>Say "bye-bye" to hesitation and tears</i>

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:49.300
<i>Now, let's go!</i>

00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:54.470
<i>Let's chase them as</i> <i>many</i> <i>times</i>
<i>as it takes, don't lose</i>

00:22:54.470 --> 00:22:57.730
<i>Everyone fails sometimes</i>

00:22:57.730 --> 00:23:00.770
<i>But dreams won't fade, dreams won't fade</i>

00:23:00.770 --> 00:23:06.150
<i>Let's chase them as</i> <i>many</i> <i>times</i>
<i>as it takes, don't lose</i>

00:23:06.150 --> 00:23:14.200
<i>'Cause today is today, and once</i>
<i>you</i> <i>wake up, it'll be a new morning</i>

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:22.210
<i>Oh, the sun's smiling down on you</i>

00:23:36.200 --> 00:23:38.850
Next Time! "Aqours WAVE."
